\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Layered architecture of TDDMachine. The presentation layer (React~18 with Ant~Design) captures the three specifications and reviews the script in a Monaco editor; the business-logic layer (Django~4.2 with Django REST Framework) chains the \texttt  {PromptBuilder}, \texttt  {ClaudeService}---the sole integration point with the Claude 3.5 Sonnet API---and \texttt  {PytestValidator} services; the persistence layer (PostgreSQL~15 on Supabase) stores projects, specifications, and tests; and the infrastructure layer deploys the backend in a Docker container on Cloud~Run and the frontend as a single-page application on Render.}}{9}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:arquitectura}{{3}{9}{Layered architecture of TDDMachine. The presentation layer (React~18 with Ant~Design) captures the three specifications and reviews the script in a Monaco editor; the business-logic layer (Django~4.2 with Django REST Framework) chains the \texttt {PromptBuilder}, \texttt {ClaudeService}---the sole integration point with the Claude 3.5 Sonnet API---and \texttt {PytestValidator} services; the persistence layer (PostgreSQL~15 on Supabase) stores projects, specifications, and tests; and the infrastructure layer deploys the backend in a Docker container on Cloud~Run and the frontend as a single-page application on Render}{figure.3}{}}
